Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:49.84,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 华盛顿 WTA500 半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:49.84,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}6-4 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 大坂直美 · 赛后采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:01.22,EN,,0,0,0,,They've been teaching me a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:01.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们教了我几个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.18,EN,,0,0,0,,of Tagalog words
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,他加禄语的词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:04.74,EN,,0,0,0,,while I was here. Congratulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,趁我在这儿 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.90,EN,,0,0,0,,not just on making your second career final,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是打进了生涯第二个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.06,EN,,0,0,0,,but on doing it against an iconic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,更因为你面对的是一位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.14,EN,,0,0,0,,opponent like Naomi Osaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,标志性的对手 大坂直美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:12.26,EN,,0,0,0,,former world number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,前世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I would imagine you'd be pretty proud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想你一定为这场表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.74,EN,,0,0,0,,of that performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm super proud of my performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我非常为自己的表现骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I played really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己打得确实不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.98,EN,,0,0,0,,and I had a great mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,心态也非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and I stayed locked in to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且一直专注到最后一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:24.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Can I assume
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:24.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是不是可以这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:27.46,EN,,0,0,0,,that you grew up watching Naomi Osaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是看着大坂直美长大的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Because I I wonder what it felt like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我很好奇那是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:30.98,EN,,0,0,0,,to be out there for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次站在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.34,EN,,0,0,0,,on the opposite side of the net
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在球网的另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:35.54,EN,,0,0,0,,from a) her power, but but b) her aura
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,一是她的力量 二是她的气场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.90,EN,,0,0,0,,because she has one, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是有气场的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, she does. She definitely has aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 她确实有气场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:40.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and she definitely has power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:40.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,力量也确实很大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:41.94,EN,,0,0,0,,I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,这我可以作证
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我确实是看着她长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.38,EN,,0,0,0,,I I remember watching her, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得看过她的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.38,EN,,0,0,0,,her finals in in the Australian Open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在澳网的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:48.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and also in the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有美网那场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:52.10,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um really a great experience to share
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以能和她同场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.62,EN,,0,0,0,,the court with her and I'm really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是很棒的经历 我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.78,EN,,0,0,0,,that I was able to to produce
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己能打出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:56.82,EN,,0,0,0,,that level against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,面对她的那种水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:57.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:59.62,EN,,0,0,0,,you generated 12 break points today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天拿到了 12 个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:00.18,EN,,0,0,0,,returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:00.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是在接发球端
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:01.06,EN,,0,0,0,,You were able to break
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:01.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这场比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.62,EN,,0,0,0,,her massive serve four times in this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,四次破掉了她的重炮发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:05.54,EN,,0,0,0,,You've rapidly become one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很快就成了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:07.86,EN,,0,0,0,,of the elite returners in women's tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,女子网坛最顶尖的接发球手之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:10.66,EN,,0,0,0,,I wonder what your mental thought process
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:10.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想知道你走上底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:12.42,EN,,0,0,0,,is as you step up to the baseline
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备接发球的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.70,EN,,0,0,0,,to return serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,脑子里是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.54,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you telling yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会对自己说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.54,0:01:17.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you saying, "Okay, just get it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.54,0:01:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是在说 好 先接进去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Just get it in with depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,接得深一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:20.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Attack. Be aggressive." What What's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,主动 打得凶一点 还是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.26,EN,,0,0,0,,the mental thing that you're telling yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,你准备接发球的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:23.46,EN,,0,0,0,,as you get ready to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,心里到底在对自己说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:25.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh it it really depends on the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的要看当时的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:27.14,EN,,0,0,0,,because there are so many factors
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:27.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为接发球要考虑的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:29.06,EN,,0,0,0,,when it comes to returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,实在太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:30.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you know, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,比如当下是什么局面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:33.06,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you looking for in the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想在这个球上找到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.06,0:01:34.34,EN,,0,0,0,,And at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.06,0:01:34.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:35.78,EN,,0,0,0,,you don't know what serve is going to come
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:35.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,你不知道她会发出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:36.50,EN,,0,0,0,,at you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,一记什么样的球 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.70,EN,,0,0,0,,So you kind of have to be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你得做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:39.62,EN,,0,0,0,,for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都可能发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,But I think whatever well I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我想 无论如何 我尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:45.46,EN,,0,0,0,,to do best what I can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,把能控制的部分做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.54,EN,,0,0,0,,So whatever I can control I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以只要是我能控制的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to do my 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都拿出百分之百
